%N A402258 Decimal expansion of the asymptotic mean of A037445(k)/A034444(k), the ratio between the number of infinitary divisors and the number of unitary divisors over the positive integers.
%C A402258 The ratio A037445(k)/A034444(k) = A382291(k) equals 1 (its minimum value) for numbers k in A138302. It is unbounded, with record values attained at values of k listed in A382293.
%F A402258 Equals lim_{m->oo} (1/m) * Sum_{k=1..m} A382291(k).
%F A402258 Equals Product_{p prime} ((1-1/p) * (1 + Product_{k>=0} (1 + 2/p^(2^k))) / 2).
%e A402258 1.145118924801216477790577430949839198335965105755619...
%o A402258 (PARI) c(kmax) = prodeulerrat((1-1/p) * (1 + prod(k = 0, kmax, 1 + 2/p^(2^k))) / 2);
%o A402258 {my(c1 = 0, c2 = 1, m = 1); while(c2 != c1, c1 = c2; c2 = c(m); m++); c2}
%Y A402258 Cf. A037445, A034444, A138302, A382291, A382293.
%Y A402258 Similar constants: A307869, A383057, A383058, A402259.
%K A402258 nonn,cons,new
%O A402258 1,3
